<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Request Strategic Assessment | Infrastructure & Cybersecurity</title>

<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
body{
    background:#0a0f1c;
    color:#eef5ff;
    font-family:Inter,system-ui;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}

.hero{
    padding:80px 20px 40px;
    text-align:center;
}

.badge-glow{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:6px 14px;
    border-radius:50px;
    background:rgba(255,179,71,0.15);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,179,71,0.4);
    color:#ffb347;
    font-size:12px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

h1{
    font-size:2.8rem;
    font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:-1px;
}

.sub{
    opacity:0.8;
    max-width:700px;
    margin:15px auto;
    line-height:1.6;
}

.container-box{
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:auto;
}

.card-glass{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:25px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
}

.highlight{
    color:#ffb347;
    font-weight:600;
}

.step{
    margin-bottom:15px;
    padding-left:25px;
    position:relative;
}
.step::before{
    content:"";
    width:10px;height:10px;
    background:#ffb347;
    position:absolute;
    left:0;top:8px;
    border-radius:50%;
}

.btn-primary{
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ffb347,#ff9f1a);
    border:none;
    color:#1a1a1a;
    font-weight:700;
    border-radius:40px;
    padding:12px;
}

.btn-outline{
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    color:white;
    border-radius:40px;
    padding:12px;
    background:transparent;
}

.form-control{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    color:white;
}

.form-control:focus{
    box-shadow:none;
    border-color:#ffb347;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}

.section{
    padding:40px 0;
}

.small-note{
    font-size:12px;
    opacity:0.6;
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:10px;
}

.icon{
    color:#ffb347;
    margin-right:8px;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="hero">
    <div class="badge-glow">EXECUTIVE STRATEGIC ASSESSMENT</div>
    <h1>Infraestructura Crítica & Cybersecurity Review</h1>
    <p class="sub">
        Evaluación diseñada para <span class="highlight">gobiernos, hospitales y empresas enterprise</span>.
        Identificamos riesgos, fallas de arquitectura y oportunidades de optimización en menos de 72 horas.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="container container-box">

<div class="row g-4">

<!-- LEFT -->
<div class="col-lg-6">

<div class="card-glass mb-4">
<h4><i class="fas fa-bullseye icon"></i>Qué recibirás</h4>

<div class="step">Diagnóstico de infraestructura IT/OT</div>
<div class="step">Evaluación de ciberseguridad (ISO 27001 readiness)</div>
<div class="step">Análisis de disponibilidad y riesgo (uptime)</div>
<div class="step">Recomendación de arquitectura enterprise</div>
<div class="step">Roadmap de modernización digital</div>

</div>

<div class="card-glass">
<h4><i class="fas fa-shield-alt icon"></i>Ideal para</h4>
<p>
• Smart Cities & Municipios<br>
• Hospitales & Salud crítica<br>
• Centros de monitoreo (CCTV / SOC)<br>
• Data Centers & Infraestructura TI<br>
• Empresas con alta disponibilidad
</p>
</div>

</div>

<!-- RIGHT FORM -->
<div class="col-lg-6">

<div class="card-glass">

<h4><i class="fas fa-paper-plane icon"></i>Solicitar evaluación</h4>

<form id="funnelForm">

<input class="form-control mb-3" type="text" id="name" placeholder="Nombre completo" required>

<input class="form-control mb-3" type="text" id="company" placeholder="Empresa / Institución" required>

<input class="form-control mb-3" type="email" id="email" placeholder="Correo corporativo" required>

<input class="form-control mb-3" type="tel" id="phone" placeholder="WhatsApp (opcional)">

<textarea class="form-control mb-3" rows="4" id="problem" placeholder="Describe tu infraestructura o problema crítico..." required></textarea>

<button class="btn btn-primary w-100 mb-2" type="submit">
<i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> Solicitar por WhatsApp
</button>

<a href="https://linkedin.com/in/haroldrosas" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline w-100">
<i class="fab fa-linkedin"></i> Contactar por LinkedIn
</a>

</form>

<div class="small-note">
Respuesta en menos de 24 horas · Solo proyectos enterprise
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<!-- TRUST STRIP -->
<div class="section text-center">

<p style="opacity:0.6;">Tecnologías de confianza</p>

<p>
Cisco · Fortinet · VMware · Microsoft · Dahua · Hikvision · Axis · Dell · HPE · Aruba
</p>

</div>

</div>

<script>
document.getElementById("funnelForm").addEventListener("submit", function(e){
    e.preventDefault();

    let name = document.getElementById("name").value;
    let company = document.getElementById("company").value;
    let email = document.getElementById("email").value;
    let phone = document.getElementById("phone").value;
    let problem = document.getElementById("problem").value;

    let text =
`Hola, soy ${name}
Empresa: ${company}
Correo: ${email}
${phone ? "WhatsApp: " + phone : ""}
Problema: ${problem}`;

    window.open("https://wa.me/51914936879?text=" + encodeURIComponent(text), "_blank");
});
</script>

</body>
</html>
